## 二、Twitter/X 内容规则

### 2.1 单条推文
- 280字符以内，**结论放第一句**
- 用数字开头效果最好：`3 things nobody tells you about fish oil 🧵`
- 结尾必须有互动钩子：`Which one did you try? Drop it below 👇`
- 不要用正式语气，要像在跟朋友说话

### 2.2 Thread（长推）结构 — 最高效的传播格式

```
Tweet 1【Hook】停住用户的拇指
  公式：Bold claim + 数字 + 承诺价值
  示例："I took fish oil every day for 90 days.
        Here's what actually happened to my skin (not what brands tell you): 🧵"

Tweet 2【Context】建立可信度
  "Quick background: I'm not a doctor.
   I'm a 31-year-old with combo skin who's spent way too much money
   on skincare that didn't work."

Tweet 3-8【每条一个核心论点】
  每条：一个观点 + 一句解释 + 一个数据/例子
  结尾加 cliffhanger："But here's where it got interesting..."

Tweet 9【Twist/惊喜】
  反转或最意外的发现，这条最容易被单独转发

Tweet 10【CTA结尾】
  "If this helped, RT the first tweet so others can see it.
   And drop your questions below — I'll answer every one."
```

### 2.3 语言风格规则

| ❌ 不要这样写 | ✅ 要这样写 |
|--------------|------------|
| This product is amazing and effective | Took it for 3 weeks. My inflammation dropped noticeably. |
| Our fish oil uses advanced technology | The EPA/DHA ratio in this is actually higher than Nordic Naturals. |
| Please follow for more content | If you found this useful, bookmark it. I post this stuff weekly. |
| 翻译腔：The effect is very obvious | Real talk: I didn't expect it to work this fast. |

### 2.4 Hashtag规则
- 每条推文最多2个hashtag，放在结尾
- 优先用niche标签而非大词：`#skincareresearch` 好过 `#skincare`
- Thread第一条可以不加hashtag，算法会自己推

